.TH KEYLATCH\-RUNTIME\-DOCTOR 1 "2026-05-13" "keylatch" "Keylatch Manual"
.SH NAME
keylatch\-runtime\-doctor \- diagnose runtime mode configuration and gateway connectivity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B keylatch runtime doctor
.RB [ \-\-json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBkeylatch runtime doctor\fR runs a series of checks to diagnose the runtime
mode configuration, gateway reachability, and credential broker status. It
reports which runtime modes are available and why certain modes may be
restricted in the current environment.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output the diagnostic report as a JSON object.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
All checks passed.
.TP
.B 1
At least one check failed.
.TP
.B 5
Operation failed (internal error).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR keylatch (1),
.BR keylatch\-run (1),
.BR keylatch\-proxy (1)
